  "body": "JSON Modules have been added, see here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4315\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4407\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to also add `JSON5` support, e.g.\r\n\r\n```js\r\nimport example from './config.json5';\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe JSON5 Data Interchange Format (JSON5) is a superset of JSON that aims to alleviate some of the limitations of JSON by expanding its syntax to include some productions from ECMAScript 5.1.\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n\r\nLinks: https://json5.org/\r\n",
